        {
          "dimension": "Smart-contract",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Vault composability chains swaps, staking, and LP positions across multiple contracts, multiplying exploit surface well beyond the vault itself — evidenced by the $3.73M stkGHO slippage loss and recurring deprecated-vault hacks.",
          "source": "https://www.cryptopolitan.com/hack-deprecated-thetanuts-vault/"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Curator-controlled vaults (MetaMorpho, GLV) concentrate allocation and risk-parameter power in small teams; Hyperliquid's mixed-vault architecture drew explicit public criticism for exposing depositors to systemic operator risk.",
          "source": "https://forum.morpho.org/t/introducing-armitage-by-wintermute-vaults-on-morpho/2269"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Governance",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The Compound 'Golden Boys' proposal redirecting ~$25M of DAO treasury to a single vault is a documented template for governance capture of protocol yield, not a hypothetical.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "ERC-4626's synchronous redemption model breaks under coordinated withdrawals; EIP-7540's async extension was proposed specifically to address vault liquidity-run risk for illiquid underlying assets like RWAs.",
          "source": "https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7540"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "RWA savings vaults (Ondo USDY, Idle private credit on Optimism) introduce securities-law surface area that standard DeFi yield vaults avoid, particularly where yield is tied to off-chain instruments.",
          "source": "https://www.rockawayx.com/insights/defi-vaults-explained-2026-guide"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Market",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Vault strategies dependent on LST/LRT premiums or stablecoin pegs (crvUSD, frxUSD) are exposed to depeg events that can rapidly compress or invert expected yields, as the WBTC offboarding from MakerDAO Legacy Vaults illustrated.",
          "source": ""
        }
      ],
